extends ../../layout

block head_styles
    style
        include ../../../assets/css/emails/teamCreated.css

block content
    h2(style="text-align: center;") Request to join your sports team 🏆

    div.message-box(style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;")
        p.message(style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #1e293b; font-size: 16px;")
            | Hello, user #[strong #{userName}] (#[strong #{userEmail}]) is requesting to join the sports team #[strong #{teamName}].
        p.message(style="margin: 0; color: #475569;")
            | Please confirm whether you want to accept or reject this request by clicking one of the options below:

    div.actions-container(style="text-align: center; margin: 35px 0;")
        a.btn-action.btn-accept(href=acceptUrl, style="background-color: #16a34a; color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; margin: 6px; display: inline-block; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;")
            | ✓ Accept Request
        a.btn-action.btn-reject(href=rejectUrl, style="background-color: #dc2626; color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; margin: 6px; display: inline-block; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;")
            | ✗ Reject Request

    div(style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center;")
        p If you do not want this athlete to join your team, you can reject this request.
